  "prompt": "For a store-wide sale, every product gets a list price of its unit cost plus a 25% markup, and is then sold at 10% off that list price. For every product, return product_id, list_price_eur (the unit cost plus the 25% markup), sale_price_eur (list_price_eur less 10%) and profit_eur (sale_price_eur minus the unit cost), in that order. All amounts are in euros. Use exactly these column names and do not round. One row per product, every product included. Any row order is fine.",
